{"id":"msg_m_ex_realkindness_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_realkindness","label":"Real Kindness · Group"},"label":"2. Guys, the weather has been fantastic the past …","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_realkindness_01","next":null,"speakers":{"quency":"Quency","guilty":"Guilty","sin":"Sin"},"icons":{"quency":"si_c402_00_s","guilty":"si_c400_00_s","sin":"si_c401_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_1","text":"Guys, the weather has been fantastic the past few days.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_2","text":"It's time for some outdoor activities!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_3","text":"Let's go for a picnic.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_4","text":"Pic Nikke？","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_5","text":"Pic? Nikke？","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_6","text":"Yeah, pic Nikke.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_7","text":"Argh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_8","text":"Can't you just ignore my typos?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_9","text":"Hehe, will do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_10","text":"Guilty, are you the only one still in your room?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_11","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_12","text":"I'm already outside.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_13","text":"Quincy is outside too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_14","text":"What about Counselor?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_15","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_15","text":"I'm outside too.","jump":"m_ex_realkindness_02_17"},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_16","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_16","text":"I'm in the Commander's Room.","jump":"m_ex_realkindness_02_19"},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_17","text":"What? Why is everyone outside?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_18","text":"What about me?","jump":"m_ex_realkindness_02_22"},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_19","text":"Good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_20","text":"If you were outside as well,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_21","text":"I'd be super mad.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_22","text":"Wow, the voice-to-text is super accurate all of a sudden!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_23","text":"Don't be upset.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_24","text":"That's why I suggested that we all go on a picnic.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_25","text":"Where do you want to go, Guilty?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_26","text":"I","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_27","text":"As long as it's outside.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_28","text":"With you, Counselor.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_29","text":"Anywhere is fine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_30","text":"Oh.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_31","text":"You poor thing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_32","text":"Poor Guilty.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_33","text":"Pool Guilty. TTT_TTT","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_34","text":"I don't need your pity.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_35","text":"You guys are the worst.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_36","text":"Geez, you don't have to rip our heads off!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_37","text":"I knew this would happen,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_38","text":"so I already laid a picnic blanket out in the park at the Outpost.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_39","text":"I also bought some Splendamin. Mint chocolate, your favorite!(((> <)))","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_40","text":"Mint chocolate?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_41","text":"I hate that flavor!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_42","text":"I'll prepare something on my own.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_43","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_44","text":"Really!! -3-","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_45","text":"That's nice.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_46","text":"Hehehe","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_47","text":"Okay, let's meet at the park.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_48","text":"Counselor, why don't you and Guilty come together?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_49","text":"Sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_50","text":"! Exclamation mark.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_51","text":"Ok, be quick, Counselor.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_52","text":"On my way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_53","text":"I know we were all just making fun of each other,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_54","text":"but this is all so touching!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_55","text":"It's so rare that Guilty has a chance to go out with us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_56","text":"I'm starting to feel emotional!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_57","text":"Yea! It feels nice!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_realkindness_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_realkindness_02_58","text":"See you later, guys!","jump":null}],"chat":true}